# Homey Apps SDK - Cursor AI Rules

This file provides guidelines for Cursor AI to write correct, maintainable Homey app code.

## How to Use This Documentation

**IMPORTANT: Before writing any Homey code, consult this file and the referenced documentation.**

### Decision Tree: What Documentation to Read

```
What are you building?
├── New Homey App from scratch
│   └── Read: _index/docs/the-basics/getting-started/index.md
│   └── Read: _index/docs/the-basics/app/manifest.md
│   └── Template: Basic App (see Code Templates below)
│
├── Device Driver
│   ├── What protocol?
│   │   ├── Zigbee → Read: _index/docs/wireless/zigbee.md
│   │   │           └── Example: _index/reference-apps/com.ikea.tradfri-example/
│   │   ├── Z-Wave → Read: _index/docs/wireless/zwave.md
│   │   │           └── Example: _index/reference-apps/node-homey-zwavedriver/
│   │   ├── Wi-Fi/HTTP → Read: _index/docs/wireless/wifi.md
│   │   │              └── Example: _index/reference-apps/com.samsung.smart/
│   │   ├── 433 MHz → Read: _index/docs/wireless/433mhz.md
│   │   │            └── Example: _index/reference-apps/nl.klikaanklikuit-example/
│   │   └── Bluetooth LE → Read: _index/docs/wireless/bluetooth-le.md
│   └── Read: _index/docs/the-basics/devices.md
│   └── Read: _index/docs/the-basics/devices/pairing.md
│
├── Flow Cards (Triggers/Conditions/Actions)
│   └── Read: _index/docs/the-basics/flow.md
│   └── Read: _index/docs/the-basics/flow/arguments.md
│
├── Widgets/Dashboard
│   └── Read: _index/docs/the-basics/widgets.md
│   └── Example: _index/reference-apps/homey.dashboards/
│
├── OAuth2/Cloud API Integration
│   └── Read: _index/docs/cloud/oauth2.md
│   └── Example: _index/reference-apps/com.netatmo/
│   └── Library: _index/reference-apps/node-homey-oauth2app/
