| Manager | Access | Purpose |
|---------|--------|---------|
| ManagerApi | `this.homey.api` | Web API access |
| ManagerApps | `this.homey.apps` | App management |
| ManagerBLE | `this.homey.ble` | Bluetooth LE |
| ManagerCloud | `this.homey.cloud` | Webhooks, OAuth2 |
| ManagerDiscovery | `this.homey.discovery` | Device discovery |
| ManagerDrivers | `this.homey.drivers` | Driver management |
| ManagerFlow | `this.homey.flow` | Flow cards |
| ManagerImages | `this.homey.images` | Image handling |
| ManagerInsights | `this.homey.insights` | Charts/logs |
| ManagerNotifications | `this.homey.notifications` | Push notifications |
| ManagerRF | `this.homey.rf` | RF signals (433/868/IR) |
| ManagerSettings | `this.homey.settings` | App settings |
| ManagerZigBee | `this.homey.zigbee` | Zigbee protocol |
| ManagerZwave | `this.homey.zwave` | Z-Wave protocol |

