## Important Issues Index

### Issue: Upgrading from SDK v2
- Callbacks removed, use async/await
- Manager access via `this.homey.*`
- See: `_index/docs/upgrade-guides/sdk-v3.md`

### Issue: Homey Cloud Constraints
- No Web API or Widgets
- No wireless (Z-Wave, Zigbee, etc.)
- Limited permissions
- See: `_index/docs/cloud/index.md`

### Issue: Device Discovery
- Use mDNS-SD, SSDP, or MAC-based discovery
- Define strategies in driver manifest
- Handle device unavailability
- See: `_index/docs/wireless/wifi.md`

### Issue: Node.js Version
- Current: Node.js 22 for latest Homey
- Use `"compatibility"` to ensure compatibility
- Avoid deprecated Node.js APIs
- See: `_index/docs/upgrade-guides/nodejs-22.md`

### Issue: Device Pairing
- Unique `data.id` is CRITICAL - never changes
- Use `store` for sensitive data, not `settings`
- See: `_index/docs/the-basics/devices/pairing.md`

### Issue: Flow Card Arguments
- Use autocomplete for dynamic values
- Register handlers in `onInit()`
- See: `_index/docs/the-basics/flow/arguments.md`

