## File Structure Reference

```
my-homey-app/
├── .homeycompose/           # Compose files (optional)
│   ├── app.json             # Base manifest
│   ├── capabilities/        # Custom capabilities
│   └── flow/                # Flow cards
│       ├── triggers/
│       ├── conditions/
│       └── actions/
├── app.js                   # Main app class
├── app.json                 # App manifest (generated if using compose)
├── api.js                   # Web API endpoints (optional)
├── assets/                  # App images
│   └── images/
│       ├── small.png        # 250x175
│       ├── large.png        # 500x350
│       └── xlarge.png       # 1000x700
├── drivers/                 # Device drivers
│   └── my-driver/
│       ├── driver.js        # Driver class
│       ├── device.js        # Device class
│       ├── driver.compose.json
│       ├── pair/            # Custom pairing views
│       └── assets/
│           └── icon.svg     # Driver icon
├── locales/                 # Translations
│   ├── en.json              # English (required)
│   └── nl.json              # Dutch
├── settings/                # App settings view (optional)
│   └── index.html
├── widgets/                 # Dashboard widgets (optional)
│   └── my-widget/
│       ├── widget.compose.json
│       ├── public/
│       │   └── index.html
│       └── preview.png
└── package.json             # NPM dependencies
```

