## Capability Quick Reference

### Most Common Capabilities
| Capability | Type | Description |
|------------|------|-------------|
| `onoff` | boolean | On/off state |
| `dim` | number (0-1) | Brightness |
| `measure_temperature` | number | Temperature (°C) |
| `measure_power` | number | Power usage (W) |
| `measure_battery` | number (0-100) | Battery % |
| `alarm_motion` | boolean | Motion detected |
| `alarm_contact` | boolean | Door/window open |
| `target_temperature` | number | Thermostat target |

For full list: See `_index/docs/api-reference/device-capabilities.md`

