## Manifest Quick Reference

### Minimum Required Manifest
```json
{
  "id": "com.company.appname",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "compatibility": ">=5.0.0",
  "sdk": 3,
  "platforms": ["local"],
  "name": { "en": "App Name" },
  "description": { "en": "Description" },
  "category": ["tools"]
}
```

### Platform Values
- `["local"]` - Homey Pro only
- `["cloud"]` - Homey Cloud only
- `["local", "cloud"]` - Both platforms
